r), each paragraph of a plain blockquote is a Quote block, and paragraphs and headings inside a `<div align>` ... `</div>` pair carry that alignment. Membership is explicit - RichListGroup (one per top-level list), RichQuoteGroup (one blockquote) and RichAlignGroup (with the wrapper's original bytes) are shared by their member blocks, and a deep document clone keeps that sharing. A group writes its original bytes only while its members are unchanged and clean, so untouched documents stay byte-identical and an edited group is never written from stale bytes. Lists with richer items, nested quotes, and div tags that are not real HTML blocks (such as indented code) stay Raw.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"coder/coder","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:40:24Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"cdc87ee047488fabfbd11b2e4a3e2108a9f61828","github_link":"https://github.com/coder/coder/commit/cdc87ee047488fabfbd11b2e4a3e2108a9f61828","commit_subject":"fix(coderd): recheck auto-archive candidates under the family lock (#30242)","ai_tool":"Xum"},{"repo_name":"nextcloud/spreed","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:40:19Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"1de6b4f28141c171c4a35dc781cc25baefba2160","github_link":"https://github.com/nextcloud/spreed/commit/1de6b4f28141c171c4a35dc781cc25baefba2160","commit_subject":"fix(chat): prevent scheduling of file uploads","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"jdeast/EXOZIPPy","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:39:52Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"447cbce05d8cc4c0c753516b01a9512b600689e0","github_link":"https://github.com/jdeast/EXOZIPPy/commit/447cbce05d8cc4c0c753516b01a9512b600689e0","commit_subject":"ob09020: drop the removed `mmexofast: false` key; record the rho-seed ruling","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"SubtitleEdit/subtitleedit","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:39:49Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"c075d371afefe14812a08d76622916b5df11a90c","github_link":"https://github.com/SubtitleEdit/subtitleedit/commit/c075d371afefe14812a08d76622916b5df11